{
  "about": "The director comparison set (features/director-v5.clan): real requests from our own test projects (handyman, marky; 2026-10-09), each with the checks a good answer passes. must: every group needs one of its phrases in the prompt. forbid: none may appear (card text the words never asked for, a style the user moved away from). roles: the role each named ref must have. only_refs: the refs the job may send. budget: characters the director may add beyond the user's words. frame_edit cases (features/frame-change-edit.clan, since director.v7): image names a still in `frames` (eval/fixtures/frames/, drawn by make_frames.py), sent to Dex as one picture. expect: reading (camera, local, both, or ask), camera (each leaf one of the values listed), changed (leaves that must change), runAs and maskUnused when they matter.",
